## Verification Plan

### Automated/Manual Verification
- Run local dev server (`npm run dev`) and test the About page layout at `/about`.
- Verify the viewport-triggered count-up animations when scrolling to the statistics section.
- Test responsive layout behavior by resizing the viewport across mobile (width < 600px), tablet (width < 850px), and desktop screen sizes.
- Verify that standard navigation and links (Explore/Compare CTA buttons) navigate correctly to `/colleges` and `/compare`.
